<title>USA: IOWA-S MINN FED CATTLE MARKET NOT TESTED - USDA.</title>
<headline>IOWA-S MINN FED CATTLE MARKET NOT TESTED - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steers and heifers were not tested on a live basis, compared with Monday's close, USDA said. Reported sales for Tuesday-None. Week to Date: 1,100</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
